      "updated": 1789125688908,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Uses ideas generated by the specialized agents, and compiles the best \nitinerary from those. Calculates travel time between destinations, and \ngathers optimal times to visit each destination. When planning routes, \nthe walking route is assumed in-zone. Public transport is assumed \nbetween-zones.",
      "fontSize": 13.520262835124267,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Uses ideas generated by the specialized agents, and compiles the best \nitinerary from those. Calculates travel time between destinations, and \ngathers optimal times to visit each destination. When planning routes, \nthe walking route is assumed in-zone. Public transport is assumed \nbetween-zones.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
